# Force LF in the repo and on checkout regardless of each developer's local
# core.autocrlf — without this, Windows checkouts rewrite LF -> CRLF, which
# fights Prettier's default endOfLine: 'lf' and makes `npm run format:check`
# flip back to red after any git operation (checkout, stash, commit) even
# though nothing in the file actually changed. See troubleshooting.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish or intentionally-CRLF-agnostic files: leave alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
